<title>UK: Rabobank sets 350 million guilder bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 350 million guilder bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    18.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.725   PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.10</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) **	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	**5-10 (K-FORM), 5-100-1M (CF-FORM)</p>
